    "summary": "In the millennial day, all men will praise the Lord—He will dwell among them—Compare 2 Nephi 22.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And in that day thou shalt say, O Lord, I will praise thee: though thou wast angry with me, thine anger is turned away, and thou comfortedst me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3,
            "text": "2 Ne. 22:1 (1–6)."
          },
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "IE in the time of the events of the preceding chapter."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "IE The people who are gathered will sing this song of praise."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, God is my salvation; I will trust, and not be afraid: for the Lord Jehovah is my strength and my song; he also is become my salvation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 82,
            "text": "This is one of the four times only that the name Jehovah is written out in full in the King James English Bible. See Ex. 6:3; Ps. 83:18; Isa. 26:4. In all other places Lord is used instead. TG Jesus Christ, Jehovah."
          },
          {
            "start": 89,
            "end": 97,
            "text": "TG Priesthood, Power of; Strength."
          },
          {
            "start": 132,
            "end": 141,
            "text": "TG Salvation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 14
          },
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 85
          },
          {
            "start": 102,
            "end": 104
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore with joy shall ye draw water out of the wells of salvation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Joy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And in that day shall ye say, Praise the Lord, call upon his name, declare his doings among the people, make mention that his name is exalted.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "TG Thanksgiving."
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "OR proclaim."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Sing unto the Lord; for he hath done excellent things: this is known in all the earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "TG Singing."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
